"color-2\">Transparency</span>\n"
"                                                </strong>\n"
"                                            </span>\n"
"                                            <br/>\n"
"                                            <span class=\"o_small-fs "
"text-600\">We tell you exactly what you're buying. Our grades are clear, our "
"prices are fair, and our process is well-documented. No surprises, ever.</"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\n"
"                                                <strong>\n"
"                                                    <span style=\"color: "
"rgb(209, 220, 242);\">01</span>\n"
"                                                    <span class=\"text-o-"
"color-2\">透明</span>\n"
"                                                </strong>\n"
"                                            </span>\n"
"                                            <br/>\n"
"                                            <span class=\"o_small-fs "
"text-600\">我们如实告诉您买的到底是什么。我们的等级清晰、价格公道、流程有据可"
"查。绝无意外。</span>"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_our_company
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\n"
"                                                <strong>\n"
"                                                    <span style=\"color: "
"rgb(209, 220, 242);\">02</span>\n"
"                                                    <span class=\"text-o-"
"color-2\">Uncompromising Quality</span>\n"
"                                                </strong>\n"
"                                            </span>\n"
"                                            <br/>\n"
"                                            <span class=\"o_small-fs "
"text-600\">\"Refurbished\" does not mean \"defective.\" Our internal "
"standards often exceed those for new products: every device is inspected, "
"repaired, and certified before it ships.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\n"
"                                                <strong>\n"
"                                                    <span style=\"color: "
"rgb(209, 220, 242);\">02</span>\n"
"                                                    <span class=\"text-o-"
"color-2\">不妥协的品质</span>\n"
"                                                </strong>\n"
"                                            </span>\n"
"                                            <br/>\n"
"                                            <span class=\"o_small-fs "
"text-600\">“整备”不等于“次品”。我们的内部标准往往高于新品：每台设备在出厂前都"
"经过检测、维修和认证。</span>"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_our_company
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\n"
"                                                <strong>\n"
"                                                    <span style=\"color: "
"rgb(209, 220, 242);\">03</span>\n"
"                                                    <span class=\"text-o-"
"color-2\">Accessibility</span>\n"
"                                                </strong>\n"
"                                            </span>\n"
"                                            <br/>\n"
"                                            <span class=\"o_small-fs "
"text-600\">High-quality technology shouldn't be reserved for just a few. We "
"make the best devices accessible to every budget, without compromising on "
"reliability.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\n"
"                                                <strong>\n"
"                                                    <span style=\"color: "
"rgb(209, 220, 242);\">03</span>\n"
"                                                    <span class=\"text-o-"
"color-2\">人人可及</span>\n"
"                                                </strong>\n"
"                                            </span>\n"
"                                            <br/>\n"
"                                            <span class=\"o_small-fs "
"text-600\">优质科技不应只属于少数人。我们让最好的设备适配每一种预算，同时不牺"
"牲可靠性。</span>"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_our_company
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\n"
"                                                <strong>\n"
"                                                    <span style=\"color: "
"rgb(209, 220, 242);\">04</span>\n"
"                                                    <span class=\"text-o-"
"color-2\">Environmental Responsibility</span>\n"
"                                                </strong>\n"
"                                            </span>\n"
"                                            <br/>\n"
"                                            <span class=\"o_small-fs "
"text-600\">For us, the circular economy isn't just a trend, it's our reason "
"for being. Every device we bring back into circulation is a victory for the "
"planet.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\n"
"                                                <strong>\n"
"                                                    <span style=\"color: "
"rgb(209, 220, 242);\">04</span>\n"
"                                                    <span class=\"text-o-"
"color-2\">环境责任</span>\n"
"                                                </strong>\n"
"                                            </span>\n"
"                                            <br/>\n"
"                                            <span class=\"o_small-fs "
"text-600\">对我们而言，循环经济不只是一股潮流，而是我们存在的理由。每台重新回"
"到流通中的设备，都是地球的一次胜利。</span>"

