"pulling up daily KPIs during a morning stand-up, Hellodoo bridges the gap "
"between your physical workspace and your digital ERP."
msgstr ""
"改变您团队与数据互动的方式。无论是仓库现场快速查库存、在休息室设定计时器，还"
"是在早间站会上调出每日 KPI，Hellodoo 都在您的物理工作空间与数字 ERP 之间架起"
"桥梁。"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Trigger product conversions on <b>any stock move</b>, allowing technicians "
"to instantly swap a device's identity as soon as it passes the testing bench."
msgstr ""
"在<b>任意库存移动</b>时触发产品转换，让技术人员在设备通过检测台的那一刻即时更"
"换其身份。"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Turning mystery boxes into valuable assets requires strict traceability. Our "
"technical conversion module empowers your team to seamlessly grade and "
"convert products, establishing the exact condition, value, and identity of "
"every device before it hits the shelves."
msgstr ""
"要把盲盒变成有价值的资产，需要严格的可追溯性。我们的技术转换模块让您的团队能"
"够无缝地对产品进行分级和转换，在设备上架前确定其确切成色、价值和身份。"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_6
msgid "Ultra-Wide &amp; Macro"
msgstr "超广角与微距"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_10
msgid ""
"Ultra-soft leatherette earpads with memory foam contour your ears for total "
"ergonomic support and natural noise isolation."
msgstr ""
"超柔软人造皮革耳垫搭配记忆棉，贴合您的耳部轮廓，提供全面的人体工学支撑和天然"
"的隔音效果。"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid ""
"Unlike consumer smart speakers, Hellodoo processes business commands "
"securely. A dedicated hardware mute button ensures complete confidentiality "
"during sensitive discussions."
msgstr ""
"与消费级智能音箱不同，Hellodoo 会安全地处理业务指令。专用硬件静音键确保敏感讨"
"论中的完全保密。"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_10
msgid "Up to 40 Hours Continuous Playback"
msgstr "最长 40 小时连续播放"

